        "EcologyExpert0": {
          "DisplayName": "Mistveil Antler",
          "Tooltip": "Movement speed +8%. After taking damage, gain another 25% movement speed for 3 seconds. Cooldown: 10 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert1": {
          "DisplayName": "Thousand-Candle Seal",
          "Tooltip": "Defense +3. Every 12 seconds reduce one hit by up to 20 damage, capped at half that hit; at least 1 damage remains.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert2": {
          "DisplayName": "Communal Brood Mark",
          "Tooltip": "Summon damage +7%. Six consecutive eligible hits on one enemy release three 12-base-damage guard bolts. Cooldown: 3 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert3": {
          "DisplayName": "Echo Marrow Pipe",
          "Tooltip": "All-class critical strike chance +5 percentage points. Every four eligible hits release a delayed 40-base-damage sound pulse, radius 4.25 tiles. Cooldown: 2 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert4": {
          "DisplayName": "Backburn Cooler",
          "Tooltip": "Immune to On Fire and Burning, not lava damage. Taking damage grants +12% all damage for 4 seconds. Cooldown: 12 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert5": {
          "DisplayName": "Autonomous Deploy Core",
          "Tooltip": "Maximum sentries +1; summon damage +6%. An eligible hit fires a 45-base-damage helper round. Cooldown: 3 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert6": {
          "DisplayName": "Living Root Sac",
          "Tooltip": "Maximum life +30. Eligible hits heal 4 life, never beyond maximum. Cooldown: 5 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert7": {
          "DisplayName": "Tombwarden Sundisc",
          "Tooltip": "Defense +6. Every 8 seconds reduce a hit from the direction you face by 30%, up to 45 damage. At least 1 damage remains.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert8": {
          "DisplayName": "Dual-Tide Crown",
          "Tooltip": "Use Ecology Tide Stance (default N) to toggle; cooldown 2 seconds. Flow: +20% movement speed. Assault: +12% all damage. These bonuses are mutually exclusive.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        },
        "EcologyExpert9": {
          "DisplayName": "Stable Orbit Ring",
          "Tooltip": "All damage +7%. Eligible hits fire a 70-base-damage phase bolt, cooldown 3 seconds. A hit of at least 80 damage is reduced by 25%, capped at 60; cooldown 15 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death."
        }
      },
