        "Set0": "After 6 seconds without damage, your next eligible hit fires a 12-base-damage mirror bolt. Cooldown: 6 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set1": "Eligible hits leave a stationary 18-base-damage wax burst after 0.5 seconds, radius 4 tiles. Cooldown: 4 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set2": "Every three eligible hits release three 8-base-damage guard needles. Cooldown: 3 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set3": "Eligible hits release a delayed 26-base-damage sound pulse, radius 4.25 tiles. Cooldown: 3 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set4": "Six eligible hits grant +10% all damage for 4 seconds. Trigger cooldown: 10 seconds. Taking damage removes two accumulated hits.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set5": "After standing still for 1.5 seconds, gain +8% all damage. Eligible hits while still fire a 46-base-damage helper round, cooldown 4 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set6": "After standing still for 1 second, regenerate an extra 1 life per second. Eligible hits plant a two-second bud firing up to three 19-base-damage needles, cooldown 5 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set7": "After 5 seconds without taking damage, reduce the next hit by 20%, capped at 30, leaving at least 1 damage. Cooldown: 10 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set8": "Ecology Tide Stance (default N): Flow grants +12% movement speed; Assault grants +6% all damage. Mutually exclusive; switching cooldown 2 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Set9": "Eligible hits release three 32-base-damage orbit bolts. Cooldown: 3 seconds.\nEquipment-generated attacks never trigger these effects again. Hit counters accept at most one hit per 0.2 seconds; friendly creatures and target dummies do not count. Cooldowns persist when unequipped or on death.",
        "Flow": "Flow stance",
        "Assault": "Assault stance"
      },
      "Keybinds": {
        "EcologyTideStance": {
          "DisplayName": "Ecology Tide Stance"
        }
      }
    }
  }
